      "Dashboard read generation retires financial data on refresh/hide/logout and late responses. Known authority failures clear sibling data. A final fresh account-scope/revision fence verifies async reports/records/account/credit data before publishing.",
      "Promise coalescing is local to one refresh of one session; no stored report cache survives actor/filter/record/quote changes. Unknown widget types remain safe unsupported placeholders. Twelve widgets use existing authenticated endpoints, exact native currency/credit values and bounded lists.",
      "Layout move/resize/add/remove stages locally until explicit Save. Unknown write survives navigation with original config/revision/key. Stale remote layout retains local draft and requires explicit reload. Saving an independent filter does not discard dirty layout edits.",
